TWEAK_NAME="Order audio sources"
TWEAK_RISK="medium"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Appends a guarded wrapper to /jci/gui/apps/system/js/systemApp.js so the entertainment source list is rebuilt with the preferred sources first, keeping the stock relative order of the rest. Set OPENCMU_AUDIO_ORDER to a comma-separated list of the stock source IDs (USB_A, USB_B, BTAudio, FMRadio, AMRadio, AuxIn); at least one ID is required. It only reorders the visible list; it never selects a source."
